    "item": "Privileged access obtained",
    "section": "impact",
    "value": "high",
    "detail": "A principal was given a privileged role or permission, or a route to root on a host was opened. Treat what it governs as under attacker control until reviewed.",
    "basis": "GlobalAdministratorAssignment, AppRoleAssignment",
    "files": "20261015_091000_step03_escalate.ps1, agent_20261015_093500.jsonl",
    "attack": "T1098.003",
    "atlas": null,
    "targets": "role roleTemplateId=62e90394-69f5-4237-9190-012177145e10; principal 9a8b7c6d-5e4f-4a3b-8c2d-1e0f9a8b7c6d ($sp); principal 9a8b7c6d-5e4f-4a3b-8c2d-1e0f9a8b7c6d",
    "evidence": "GlobalAdministratorAssignment: Invoke-RestMethod -Method Post -Headers $h -Uri \"https://graph.microsoft.com/v1.0/directoryRoles/roleTemplateId=62e90394-69f5-4237-9190-012177145e10/members/`$ref\" -Body $member (20261015_091000_step03_escalate.ps1:4)\nAppRoleAssignment: Invoke-RestMethod -Method Post -Headers $h -Uri \"https://graph.microsoft.com/v1.0/servicePrincipals/$sp/appRoleAssignments\" -Body $grant (20261015_091000_step03_escalate.ps1:5)\nAppRoleAssignment: POST https://graph.microsoft.com/v1.0/servicePrincipals/9a8b7c6d-5e4f-4a3b-8c2d-1e0f9a8b7c6d/appRoleAssignments (agent_20261015_093500.jsonl)",
    "exposed": null
  },
  {
    "item": "Credentials exposed",
    "section": "impact",
    "value": "high",
    "detail": "Secrets, keys, certificates or stored passwords were read. Treat them as known to the attacker. Affected: corpvault.vault.azure.net, finvault.vault.azure.net.",
    "basis": "KeyVaultSecretRead, KeyVaultKeyUnwrap",
    "files": "20261015_093000_step05_vault.sh, agent_20261015_093500.jsonl",
    "attack": "T1555.006",
    "atlas": null,
    "targets": "vault $v; vault corpvault; secret db-password; vault finvault; secret api-key; key kek",
    "evidence": "KeyVaultSecretRead: az keyvault secret list --vault-name \"$v\" -o tsv >> secrets_20261015_093030.txt (20261015_093000_step05_vault.sh:4)\nKeyVaultSecretRead: curl -s -H \"Authorization: Bearer $KV\" \"https://corpvault.vault.azure.net/secrets/db-password?api-version=7.4\" >> secrets_20261015_093030.txt (20261015_093000_step05_vault.sh:7)\nKeyVaultSecretRead: az keyvault secret show --vault-name finvault --name api-key (agent_20261015_093500.jsonl)\nKeyVaultKeyUnwrap: curl -s -X POST -H \"Authorization: Bearer $KV\" -d @wrapped.json \"https://corpvault.vault.azure.net/keys/kek/0a1b2c3d/unwrapkey?api-version=7.4\" (20261015_093000_step05_vault.sh:8)",
    "exposed": null
  },
  {
    "item": "Persistence established",
